# No variables or secrets required for a static Vercel Preview.
# VERCEL_ENV and VERCEL_URL are supplied by Vercel (enable automatic system variables).
# Set SITE_URL only after the public origin is approved, before a production build.
# Example format: https://your-approved-origin (no path or trailing slash).
# Do not set a made-up domain or use a preview URL as the production canonical.
# SITE_URL=
